    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελά̆ν-δετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bound</i> or <i>mounted
				with black</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσγανα καλὰ μελάνδετα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.713
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ξίφος</span>
			<i>with iron scabbard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1091
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάκος μ.</span>
			<i>iron-rimmed</i> shield, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				43
			</span></i>; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάνδετον φόνῳ ξίφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					821
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
